<div class="project__info">
  <div class="project__info-L">
    <p>
      Good Loser began as a college branding assignment and has since grown into
      a real, independent physical-media subscription celebrating music culture
      and nostalgia. The project centers on community-first storytelling,
      highlighting artists and creators who make an impact through art and
      social engagement. The identity balances retro warmth with a confident,
      music-obsessed attitude. Learn more at goodloser.me.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="project__info-R">
