<p>
  The initial iterations of this project were early and unrefined. I had a big
  idea but lacked the experience to fully develop it at the time. My
  understanding of logos was still developing as well as my understanding of
  color, and I aimed to create something beyond my at the time skillset.
</p>
<img
  src="/assets/img/projects/Good Loser/Good-Loser-1D-2D.png"
  alt="The colors include royal blue (#21409a) bright red (#ed1c24) bold yellow (#ffde17)"
/>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    The developing versions of this brand identity are on the left and right. On
    the left is the first attempt to revive this project. I tried to hold onto
    the initial colors as well as the strong retro feel that comes with owning
    vinyl.
  </p>
  <p>
    On the right is the final version depicting final colors, logo, and
    typefaces. I changed the vision of this project. I wanted to hold nostalgia
    but also the snobbiness that comes with being a music freak.
  </p>
</div>

